---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Disclaimer | Influx Financial"
  description="Important information about the general nature of content on this website, calculators, third-party information and lending criteria."
  heading="Disclaimer"
  path="/disclaimer"
  lastUpdated={new Date('2026-07-01')}
>
  <h2>General information only</h2>
  <p>
    The information on this website is general in nature. It has been prepared without taking into
    account your objectives, financial situation or needs, and is not financial, credit, legal or
    tax advice. Before acting on any information on this site, consider whether it is appropriate
    for your circumstances and seek advice from appropriately qualified professionals.
  </p>

  <h2>Lending criteria</h2>
  <p>
    All loan products described on this website are subject to lender assessment and approval.
    Interest rates, fees, charges and lending criteria vary between lenders and change over time.
    Nothing on this website is an offer of credit.
  </p>

  <h2>Comparing loan options</h2>
  <p>
    Where we describe comparing loans "across our panel", this means the lenders on the Influx
    Financial panel, not every product in the Australian market.
  </p>

  <h2>Government schemes and figures</h2>
  <p>
    Government grants, schemes, thresholds and concessions change frequently. Content about them is
    reviewed periodically (see the "last reviewed" dates on relevant pages) but may not reflect the
    latest settings. Always confirm current eligibility criteria from official sources or with our
    team before relying on them.
  </p>

  <h2>Calculators</h2>
  <p>
    Calculators provide estimates based on the figures and assumptions shown. They do not assess
    your borrowing capacity and are not a substitute for a formal assessment.
  </p>

  <h2>Case studies and testimonials</h2>
  <p>
    Client stories and testimonials describe individual, verified experiences. Outcomes depend on
    personal circumstances and are not a prediction or guarantee of results for other clients.
  </p>

  <h2>Tax and accounting content</h2>
  <p>
    Tax-related content is general in nature. Accounting and tax services are provided by OneHQ
    Accounting [OWNER TO CONFIRM: entity details and registered tax agent number]; tax outcomes
    depend on individual circumstances.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    If anything on this site is unclear, contact us at
    <a href={site.contact.emailHref}>{site.contact.email}</a> or {site.contact.phone} before making decisions.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
